/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3aae87 wpr-button-icon-a-position-left wpr-button-icon-b-position-right elementor-widget elementor-widget-wpr-dual-button\" data-id=\"b3aae87\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wpr-dual-button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"wpr-dual-button\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wpr-button-a-wrap elementor-clearfix\">\n\t\t<a class=\"wpr-button-a wpr-button-effect wpr-button-none\" data-text=\"Go 1\" href=\"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/classes\/\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<span class=\"wpr-button-content-a\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wpr-button-text-a\">Join Program<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wpr-button-b-wrap elementor-clearfix\">\n\t\t<a class=\"wpr-button-b wpr-button-effect wpr-button-none\" data-text=\"Go\" href=\"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/contact\/\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<span class=\"wpr-button-content-b\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wpr-button-text-b\">Contact Us<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Ashtanga Yoga The Disciplined Path to Inner Power and Purification Ashtanga Yoga in South Delhi \u2014 Discipline, Strength, Clarity Ashtanga Yoga is the original power yoga \u2014 a precise, energetic sequence of postures synchronised with breath, practised in the same order every time. This repetition is not rigidity; it is the architecture of transformation. At Yoga Inner Power in South Delhi, Shikha Arya teaches Ashtanga with the discipline the practice demands and the warmth that makes it sustainable. Who is Ashtanga Yoga For? Ashtanga suits people who want a structured, progressive challenge. Entrepreneurs, athletes, and professionals in South Delhi who thrive on discipline and measurable progress consistently find Ashtanga to be the practice that finally matches their energy. It builds not just physical power, but extraordinary mental fortitude \u2014 the kind that follows you into every boardroom and difficult conversation. Ashtanga Yoga Classes South Delhi \u2014 Key Details Taught following the traditional Primary Series with proper adjustments Suitable for intermediate practitioners and motivated beginners Private Ashtanga sessions available at your home across South Delhi Builds core strength, flexibility, and intense mental focus Shikha provides anatomical guidance to ensure a safe, injury-free practice The Tradition: A Systematic Path to Purification Ashtanga Yoga is a traditional system that follows a specific sequence of postures designed to purify the body and calm the mind. Unlike more free-form practices, Ashtanga maintains a structured approach that has been passed down through generations. Fixed sequence of postures practiced in the same order every time Progressive series starting with Primary (Yoga Chikitsa) for detoxification Traditional lineage maintained through direct teacher-student transmission Eight-limbed path encompassing moral, physical, and spiritual practices The Practice Styles: Mysore and Led Classes Ashtanga offers two complementary approaches to learning and deepening your practice, catering to different needs and experience levels. Mysore Style (Self-Practice): Individual pacing within group setting Personalized adjustments and progression Develops self-discipline and awareness Traditional method of learning Teacher gives postures one-by-one Led Classes: Collective practice with count Perfects timing and rhythm Builds stamina and endurance Refines understanding of sequence Suitable for all levels Class Structure and What to Expect Understanding the typical flow of an Ashtanga practice helps students prepare mentally and physically for this disciplined method. Opening Mantra: Traditional chant to focus the mind Sun Salutations (Surya Namaskar A &amp; B): Warming up and building heat Standing Sequence: Foundation postures for strength and stability Primary Series: Main sequence of seated and finishing postures Closing Sequence: Inversions and restorative poses Whispers of the Breath Connect, Grow and Thrive Together Ashtanga Yoga is more than a physical practice\u2014it&#8217;s a path to self-discovery and inner transformation. Through disciplined practice, you&#8217;ll build not just physical strength, but mental clarity and spiritual awareness. Join Program Contact Us<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[],"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-1912","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1912","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1912"}],"version-history":[{"count":19,"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1912\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2364,"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1912\/revisions\/2364"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/yogainnerpower.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1912"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}